   "text": "# break-even\n5m TTL:  1.25x write + 0.1x read   -> pays off from call 2\n1h TTL:  2.00x write + 0.1x read   -> pays off from call 3\nevery cache_prefix site here makes >= 4 calls  -> 1h always wins",
   "originalText": "# break-even\n5m TTL:  1.25x write + 0.1x read   -> pays off from call 2\n1h TTL:  2.00x write + 0.1x read   -> pays off from call 3\nevery cache_prefix site here makes >= 4 calls  -> 1h always wins",
